## Frontend environment variables (Vite)
#
# IMPORTANT:
# - The app loads variables from `frontend/.env` (and `.env.[mode]`) automatically.
# - This file is only a template. Copy it to `frontend/.env` and edit values there.
#
# Local development:
# - Leave `VITE_API_BASE_URL` empty to use the dev proxy (`/api` -> http://localhost:3026)
# - Or set origin only (http://host:3026) or full API base (http://host:3026/api); both work.
#
# Production (Hostinger VPS):
# - Use your public API base including `/api`, e.g. https://dashbackend.thrivebrands.ai/api
#
# Examples (pick one):
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://192.168.50.107:3026
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://dashbackend.thrivebrands.ai/api
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
